//! tr kodlu 1
// Error 13 — A property of none.
// Message code: H2466
// What happens: Reaching a property or method of something whose value is none raises an error at run time.
// Why: A missing dict key gives none; none has no methods.
// Fixed version:
//     print((person["surname"] ?? "unknown").upper()) // or safe access: person["surname"]?.upper()
// Run (from the project root): tr examples/en/errors/13_property_of_none.tr   (exit code 1)

A030 person = {"name": "Ali"}
G100(person["surname"].Y100())
